WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.790
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:30.010 --> 00:01:34.040
Our final hope was to summon the three Gods.

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:38.380
Hoping their overwhelming power will defeat Zorc.

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:43.460
But Zorc’s dark powers were greater than the three Gods.

00:01:43.460 --> 00:01:48.560
Unable to fulfill our wishes, the three Gods lost against Zorc.

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:53.890
Do we no longer have any hope?

00:01:53.890 --> 00:01:59.900
Zorc vs Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon

00:02:07.870 --> 00:02:13.620
As the Pharaoh regains his memories, the labyrinth of the heart vanishes.

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:14.910
However...

00:02:57.760 --> 00:02:58.690
Prince!

00:02:58.690 --> 00:03:00.160
Pharaoh!

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:03.600
Pull yourself together, Prince!

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:07.760
Prince!  Get up!

00:03:12.010 --> 00:03:13.630
I’m invincible.

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:19.660
Even your Gods can't defeat me.

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:24.270
The Pharaoh and the Gods have been defeated.

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:25.890
How terrible!

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:28.020
The gods have forsaken us!

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:30.050
It’s all over.

00:03:30.050 --> 00:03:32.270
This kingdom will be destroyed!

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:33.860
Run!

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:37.330
Stop!  Hold your ground!

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:39.760
Fight to the very end!

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:43.480
Run away!

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:54.640
Mana, evacuate the Pharaoh to the palace.

00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:58.230
I’ll stop Zorc.

00:03:58.230 --> 00:03:59.460
Seto?

00:03:59.720 --> 00:04:01.200
Hurry!

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:02.390
R-Right!

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:05.390
Prince, pull yourself together!

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:08.660
Take care of the Pharaoh, Mana.

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:10.700
Let's go, Kisara.

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:23.660
You fool.  You still oppose me?

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:25.350
Perish!

00:04:27.170 --> 00:04:31.830
Zorc, I won't let you conquer this kingdom!

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:36.720
Lend me your strength, Kisara!

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:43.000
Come forth, White Dragon!

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:58.720
Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.180
What's that?

00:05:23.180 --> 00:05:26.290
Is that white dragon our ally?

00:05:26.290 --> 00:05:27.940
It’s overpowering Zorc!

00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:31.610
This is the power of the White Dragon...

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:48.060
Kisara!

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:04.810
He's draining my strength.

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:10.830
The White Dragon is just as powerful as the Gods.

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:17.800
But it’s impossible to defeat me because I’m greater than the Gods!

00:06:21.930 --> 00:06:25.560
Ki...sa...ra...

00:06:39.850 --> 00:06:41.310
No good!

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:43.680
It’s impossible to destroy the evil god!

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:45.420
It really is over!

00:06:48.770 --> 00:06:51.060
Blue-Eyes was defeated?

00:07:19.490 --> 00:07:21.620
Help me!

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:30.480
Zorc!

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:32.100
Hurry!

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:34.290
Brother, I’m scared!

00:07:34.900 --> 00:07:36.400
I’m scared!

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:43.810
Hurry!  Run!

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:50.570
Don’t do it!

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:56.920
Run!

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:12.540
I'll never forgive you!

00:08:20.670 --> 00:08:21.810
What?

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:25.360
Come forth, Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:31.100
What?

00:08:31.890 --> 00:08:33.790
I know who you are.

00:08:33.790 --> 00:08:36.080
You’re Seto Kaiba.

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:38.960
You dare oppose me?

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:41.230
Be quiet!

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:46.110
I don’t care who you are or what happens to this world!

00:08:46.110 --> 00:08:53.220
But I won’t accept using people’s lives for a game!

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:56.150
Or Blue-Eyes’s defeat!

00:08:56.150 --> 00:09:00.790
Travel through 3,000 years to evolve to your ultimate form!

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:05.490
My most powerful servant!

00:09:06.260 --> 00:09:08.900
Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon!

00:09:11.120 --> 00:09:12.300
What?

00:09:12.300 --> 00:09:14.680
Take this, you freak!

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:18.830
The light that surpasses dimensions and creates the road to my future!

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:21.870
Blue-Eyes!  Ultimate Burst!

00:09:30.610 --> 00:09:32.830
How dare you!

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:38.360
Find out what happens when you oppose me!

00:09:41.290 --> 00:09:45.230
Die along with your Ultimate Dragon!

00:09:45.490 --> 00:09:49.170
Fire back, Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon!

00:09:49.170 --> 00:09:50.970
Zorc Inferno!

00:09:50.970 --> 00:09:53.410
Ultimate Burst!

00:09:57.840 --> 00:10:02.740
I tribute Marshmallon and Silent Magician!

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:05.450
I summon Gandora the Dragon of Destruction!

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:06.700
What?

00:10:11.650 --> 00:10:19.120
Bakura, my deck has one card that can break your Zombie Lockdown Deck.

00:10:20.290 --> 00:10:23.670
Break my Zombie Lockdown?

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:31.910
Gandora the Dragon of Destruction's special magic attack!

00:10:32.930 --> 00:10:35.220
Destroy Gigarays!

00:10:52.850 --> 00:10:56.170
That effect destroys all monsters on the field?

00:10:56.170 --> 00:11:00.040
I'm surprised Yugi would use this monster.

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:03.440
This is the deck that Yugi built on his own.

00:11:03.920 --> 00:11:05.470
He’s serious.

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:09.680
This monster symbolizes that he's willing to separate from the other Yugi.

00:11:09.680 --> 00:11:14.830
Due to its special magic attack, Gandora is also destroyed!

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:22.790
Since a monster went to my graveyard, Spirit Sword of Sealing’s seal is removed.

00:11:23.400 --> 00:11:27.340
Come back, Silent Swordsman LV7!

00:11:28.490 --> 00:11:31.170
4500 attack points?

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:34.170
Silent Swordsman attacks!

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:37.110
Silent Sword Level 7!

00:11:40.540 --> 00:11:42.630
You did it, Yugi!

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:43.870
Yugi!

00:11:43.870 --> 00:11:50.420
How could I lose to a vessel...

00:11:50.690 --> 00:11:53.360
I win this duel!

00:11:55.370 --> 00:11:59.030
But I was able to stall you for long enough.

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:20.750
The nameless Pharaoh’s Ba is like a candle in the wind.

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:28.190
If he dies, I win this ultimate Shadow Game.

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:37.890
Honda?

00:12:37.890 --> 00:12:38.500
Honda!

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:40.170
Honda!

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:43.290
Pull yourself together, Honda!

00:12:43.290 --> 00:12:44.630
Honda!

00:12:47.840 --> 00:12:50.850
Huh?  Where am I?

00:12:50.850 --> 00:12:52.730
What am I doing here?

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:54.220
You fool!

00:12:54.220 --> 00:12:56.890
You were possessed by Bakura!

00:12:56.890 --> 00:12:58.180
Huh?  No way!

00:12:58.180 --> 00:13:00.270
It’s true!

00:13:00.270 --> 00:13:03.880
You put us in danger!

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:05.270
Seriously?

00:13:05.270 --> 00:13:07.600
But it's fine now.

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:11.270
Yugi defeated Bakura when he was possessing you.

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:12.640
He did?

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:14.810
Sorry, Yugi!

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:16.220
Don’t worry about it.

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:18.320
More importantly...

00:13:20.010 --> 00:13:21.710
What was that?

00:13:21.710 --> 00:13:22.900
Let’s hurry!

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:25.840
We have to find my other self!

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:29.130
Wait up!

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:40.720
We're getting down from here?

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:42.820
Stop being scared!  Let’s go!

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:52.620
Them again!

00:13:52.620 --> 00:13:55.920
They’ll do anything to stop us.

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:57.760
Dammit!

00:13:58.540 --> 00:13:59.880
Hey, Honda!

00:13:59.880 --> 00:14:00.850
Honda!

00:14:01.250 --> 00:14:05.790
I have to atone for causing you trouble!

00:14:08.900 --> 00:14:10.160
Honda!

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:18.150
Jonouchi!

00:14:19.810 --> 00:14:21.070
A Duel Disk?

00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:22.470
I see!

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:32.390
In this world, whatever we wish for becomes real.

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:34.240
I see!

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:36.660
That means I can do it too!

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:40.700
Let’s do this, Honda!

00:14:40.700 --> 00:14:43.670
Yeah!  It’s been awhile since we caused a ruckus together!

00:14:43.670 --> 00:14:46.870
Go, Gearfried and Flame Swordsman!

00:14:51.630 --> 00:14:54.640
Lava and Swamp Battleguards!

00:15:02.430 --> 00:15:03.990
Yugi!  Anzu!

00:15:04.560 --> 00:15:09.850
Use your mind and think about going to my other self's location!

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:12.290
Right!

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:19.160
Wow!

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:20.930
We’re really flying!

00:15:20.930 --> 00:15:25.330
Then if we wish for them to be gone, won’t they disappear?

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:27.910
Nice idea, Honda!

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:30.870
I want them gone!

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:34.970
They didn’t vanish.

00:15:34.970 --> 00:15:37.740
I knew it was too good to be true.

00:15:38.180 --> 00:15:39.760
Let’s hurry!

00:15:39.760 --> 00:15:41.700
And get to my other self!

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:42.800
Right!

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:57.830
What’s going on?

00:15:57.830 --> 00:16:02.820
We’re flying over Egypt, but I can’t get into contact with my brother.

00:16:04.530 --> 00:16:06.450
What’s that light?

00:16:08.640 --> 00:16:13.010
Is that Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon?

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:21.350
What's happening?

00:16:35.780 --> 00:16:36.850
What’s that?

00:16:38.410 --> 00:16:42.780
Your arrival has opened up a new path for me.

00:16:42.780 --> 00:16:48.610
But Kaiba, the only path for you is death!

00:16:54.550 --> 00:16:56.490
You punk!

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:05.380
Prince, I will give you my Ba.

00:17:07.730 --> 00:17:08.870
Prince!

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:10.650
Mana, I...

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:14.280
Prince, don’t push yourself!

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:19.970
That monster...

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:24.120
When Seto’s Ka was defeated, the same Ka appeared.

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:26.300
And changed into that form.

00:17:26.300 --> 00:17:31.000
I don’t know whose Ka it is, but it’s fighting for us!

00:17:37.960 --> 00:17:39.320
Kaiba!

00:17:41.520 --> 00:17:42.800
That's...

00:17:42.800 --> 00:17:46.220
We don't have much time left.

00:17:46.220 --> 00:17:48.310
Mana, I need the Millennium Scale!

00:17:48.310 --> 00:17:49.750
Okay!

00:17:51.440 --> 00:17:54.810
I'll use all my Ba for this single strike.

00:17:54.810 --> 00:17:56.880
I will risk my life!

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:59.960
Karim, lend me your strength!

00:17:59.960 --> 00:18:01.220
Prince...

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:09.110
Prince!

00:18:09.710 --> 00:18:10.770
Kaiba!

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:12.470
Yugi!

00:18:25.220 --> 00:18:27.720
Dragon Master Knight!

00:18:30.300 --> 00:18:32.370
Here we go, Zorc!

00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:38.570
How annoying.

00:19:01.860 --> 00:19:03.120
Did we defeat him?

00:19:09.730 --> 00:19:10.940
What?

00:19:20.020 --> 00:19:21.420
Pharaoh...

00:19:21.420 --> 00:19:26.160
Guardian of the Pharaoh’s soul, guide me!

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:55.810
In the beginning, the world was covered in darkness.

00:19:56.300 --> 00:19:59.740
From that darkness, a light appeared.

00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:01.830
Light and dark.

00:20:01.830 --> 00:20:05.370
Dark existed before light.

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:08.020
That's the truth of this world.

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:17.620
But foolish humans were afraid of the dark, believing light represented hope.

00:20:17.630 --> 00:20:22.380
Not realizing that the light was small and powerless.

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:27.070
That light is you, nameless Pharaoh.

00:20:27.520 --> 00:20:34.410
A weak soul like you has no chance of defeating me!

00:20:34.860 --> 00:20:38.350
Zorc, even if I physically die...

00:20:38.350 --> 00:20:43.780
...the light in my soul will pass on to another, so it will never disappear!

00:20:43.780 --> 00:20:46.220
Not until it defeats you!

00:20:46.590 --> 00:20:50.160
Then as you wish, die!

00:20:57.920 --> 00:20:58.870
Hasan!

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:07.180
You’re Shadi!

00:21:07.180 --> 00:21:10.180
Pharaoh, you must not give up.

00:21:10.180 --> 00:21:14.620
The light of hope that believes in you is heading this way.

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:16.560
Light of hope?

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:21.220
Shadi!

00:21:21.850 --> 00:21:23.340
Shadi...

00:21:40.910 --> 00:21:44.280
Wait for us, my other self!

00:22:01.310 --> 00:22:15.930
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:16.090 --> 00:22:31.650
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:32.370 --> 00:22:37.490
Without a goal in mind

00:22:38.810 --> 00:22:46.060
We just step towards our dream

00:22:46.450 --> 00:22:51.700
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:51.890 --> 00:23:00.170
Your eye will find it

00:23:00.530 --> 00:23:05.980
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:06.770 --> 00:23:14.120
Will touch your soul

00:23:14.310 --> 00:23:17.380
In a duel

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:30.380
The three Gods lost.

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:36.990
Even Kaiba and the Pharaoh's ultimate Fusion Monster - Dragon Master Knight - couldn't defeat Zorc.

00:23:36.990 --> 00:23:41.370
The Pharaoh feels hopeless, but don't give up!

00:23:41.370 --> 00:23:44.620
We found your real name!

00:23:44.620 --> 00:23:50.630
We're coming to give you your final hope!

00:23:50.630 --> 00:23:53.650
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
In the Name of the Pharaoh!!

00:23:53.650 --> 00:23:55.100
Stay tuned!
